# Figma MCP

This project is a Vite + React portfolio styled with CSS files (not Tailwind). When implementing a Figma design:

- Call `get_design_context` before writing UI code. Treat the returned React + Tailwind as a reference, then adapt it to this repo's components and CSS.
- Reuse existing pages, layout, and tokens in `src/` instead of generating a parallel design system.
- The Figma MCP server provides an assets endpoint which can serve image and SVG assets.
- If the Figma MCP server returns a localhost or `https://.../api/mcp/asset/...` source for an image or SVG, use that asset. Download and commit bytes that should live in the repo; do not redraw icons or leave placeholders.
- Do not import or add new icon packages. Assets should come from the Figma payload or this repo.
- After implementing, match spacing, type, and color to the screenshot from Figma.
